bug_report:
confusing diagnostic for member-declaration with missing identifier
#include <vector>

struct Input {
	std::vector<std::vector<float>>;
};


$ g++ xxx.cc
xxx.cc:4:7: error: a template-id may not appear in a using-declaration
  std::vector<std::vector<float>>;
       ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~


Perhaps this diagnostic could be worded better to clearly show the problem being the missing variable name.
